{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a36823baed9e2a399b85b518dd1862222eb458e43f6c94e2462b44aa3156739a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:356015c1a1f762c80ceea62c4c93a3b68cb2b3696c3e41d2acc427a8d0a991a2",
      "text": "倾注珍贵的心意",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f13cf95f000bf2ffcd1e73b2f7065519b0787415bd7a79a5b3e36849907e374",
      "text": "客户听说武喜欢猫和猫咪周边，\n便发来了联名猫咪周边的邀约。\n武虽然着手开始构思设计，\n却在主题上犯了难，迟迟无法动笔……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:356015c1a1f762c80ceea62c4c93a3b68cb2b3696c3e41d2acc427a8d0a991a2",
      "text": "倾注珍贵的心意",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b03a17dff93f42b5b12c5570892b92c06b41403ea6e633e83a1aa01ee65c8860",
      "text": "辛苦了，武先生。\n让您久等了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9104ba9bb9c965c622698674af9f239509bc70ca87306b6e5d132b9014070229",
      "text": "没，不要紧。\n所以，要谈的工作是什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd506d3f80f551783f7e0b03a86037cab2707708b1332ea23c2af27834cd00f4",
      "text": "其实，是客户听说武先生喜欢猫和猫咪周边，\n主动联系了我们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a64bf2064a0a5e860ca91457e2052aee860c526a5107cb8661f5c47cc42f1ef0",
      "text": "收到了希望能和武先生联名推出猫咪周边的邀约！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36a38ac86a89564fa563982d1bb8851b6e5c2b8837f14a6cf6b82962c5e6765a",
      "text": "周边联名吗。\n我有什么需要做的事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49dbc737408b7509e6801afd64f39aaeb3bfe4b48497ad0ed4f53ddb497c40cd",
      "text": "有的！需要您提提看想做怎样的周边，\n以及在周边里加入怎样的图案主题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b6a26608c5acd74baab9514c4485eda6edacf2520b913f6442e0b2d50e66c86",
      "text": "设计方面会拜托专业人士负责，\n所以您只要构想大致的形象就可以。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e024e7b91b22f115272bd15c54aae86912922cdcb290eccf283b276f889af7da",
      "text": "原来如此。那样的话我也能做得到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a47b4ef457b14d044e4dc4cd8e99e92814ad5d80b1f748693b8d5d4688e640d",
      "text": "居然知道我喜欢猫啊。\n挺开心的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab61c5ca799424842d24d3ea045ca1d7b52755e01b7b8ebac4c1e65367e21e86",
      "text": "这份工作，当然请让我接下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf0f98e32dd37ee59fd2dbc450aa7c620b767e9790e0643a8539ee3378043fef",
      "text": "那么，这是这次工作的资料。\n内容刚才已经说明过了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b26e5b19aa70057576487d2a136cf378be17a25fb35d8338cc3fdf1077e92343",
      "text": "构想一下想做成怎样的内容，\n然后提交给客户吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f0330412b7b3668602af55e6a0cdf9ce1d5b4b7e870f347fa597d98b1913186",
      "text": "感觉平时能用得上的东西会比较好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3891585efbd76f8225cf68262b016e09af9ced012e52978a800e7d11e23140b",
      "text": "像能一起玩耍的东西，或是能佩戴在身上的东西，\n你觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68187089bae5b557e74a96dae9220be54c884c6a79cf07baa04095ce86ad07ee",
      "text": "我觉得很好！要说能一起玩的，\n逗猫棒之类的周边应该挺不错呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24c7f9e84922989a2db759fbed79900018ad616485d1abe502afc0f67aa08569",
      "text": "嗯。再来虽然很普通，但项圈之类的也可以吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08e5bfcc984d1e9c899368a2253f28c77d29f0626fd2a66e2a309bc38bb5b57e",
      "text": "很棒呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55359c32a9df44737473f751926ef7fce531c9eb5a926feaed94b77a0fef34a5",
      "text": "那么，周边种类就按这个方向来吧。\n接下来就是考虑主题图案了对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6618f29cd0348aba1c88e4ff98c12f52dc513142e117c56aafd23756f8639fe",
      "text": "要加入周边的图案主题吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_c:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3821ae225a760c2222e104b509e3a35d3f6aaef82c62ad79c4fbf8c57e3a7ad3",
      "text": "签名……？老虎……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cb7f64c11cee7df34658562350ed737ac1b0edbeaa0b24199c991fe9960ab51",
      "text": "……感觉每个都很像我的风格，\n但总觉得不太对劲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8a9a40ce3959f355530cf0d4dd5d4cb04cf29417513afd98bd803fc58e4bd14",
      "text": "其他还能作为主题的东西……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73569d40711eae3252df9183bf116bc588f4d591225ec3adca8794d40b7e568a",
      "text": "拳击手套也不错，但果然\n还是觉得哪里不对。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44ed36361bda4ae46dc422d182aa500a74e5c988a55296dad69c2a66876e7a20",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n能不能给我点建议？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5c506781e62e521126440b9d7b2a5fcd4abe62574313795c8bcaa584e35d323",
      "text": "这个嘛……把武先生珍视的事物\n作为主题，您觉得如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88ac1fade1e22808d7120631d05dfc94eaab76d288621873abc55583c5fba581",
      "text": "珍视的事物？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0b0a647046f677e1c7051866a74f987d3bc4bc7741e8264ed5b18f42eaaf6c6",
      "text": "是的。从很有武先生风格的事物中，\n挑选出特别的存在。您觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a05ee593c5770751febc84b163652ab67f30dd5e9a515d66caecc7a69d54c6b8",
      "text": "这样啊，或许不错……我所珍视的事物。\n要是这样的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_d:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfc4617a7c8d2738384a7de8b620ea883bffa8eaeb62e43f44cb094b166c8273",
      "text": "对我而言珍贵的事物……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a3d2ce0dc597c3e07bc1eeb99ebb3c7180f26e3341139a1718be103545798cd",
      "text": "（……弟弟和妹妹，只有他们了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55b128b7cc236b64e23024baa9e500de5817ca8897249c09c70db37baf94dcf0",
      "text": "（他们对我来说比什么都重要。\n既然如此……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f01c4a953192816f8592dda245924021836e47e86bf3683cb39c87393ae1561d",
      "text": "……比如，这种怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bd3ece5c75ff72ef68790835f4f9805ada26c563eff130a81c5dd7a52c0a388",
      "text": "这是，两只猫咪……吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c5a27598bedac558d38f7da880163136600c3f633d1aca3a276f4e32db05765",
      "text": "嗯。是两只猫咪兄妹，\n依偎在一起玩耍的构想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_d:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a998688d5cb68c53b911cee740f8c109fb7742735844b514d2aff50ef234aa5c",
      "text": "无论何时都很开心、无忧无虑地玩着。\n要是能展现出那种氛围就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:412eb51efc5d00b58e48955dc536a6af335ab1c9a135dc34f3cad85144d4b2b5",
      "text": "太棒了！\n我觉得非常不错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15a33c2148ecd615298ba734209a0c150577c356bba921f9aa9c957cb2801574",
      "text": "太好了。\n那就拜托用这个吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9fdc61aa82aa92351a6bf9cf0d5461e6da779e8f6617a51135ba22cd7f5473b",
      "text": "好的。\n我去向客户提议看看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6233cb7306aba771279f3fd7b8443ccc436c372bfdf115e28ee7a45ce86bfc39",
      "text": "（依偎在一起幸福玩耍的猫咪兄妹……\n希望他们两个，也能像这样生活着）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_e:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a40248a047b34eca4002dcdf855823097e67ae97e2d83de4a83373b48f972a",
      "text": "数周后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_e:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09264628b172436abc8757dc6a4af66aa007a252f6989ead669f2a5cdb8b5352",
      "text": "武先生！前阵子您构思好主题图案的\n周边样品送到了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ace5ad3e1f0bbadb55ba5d8a0bde83280a40e7f3ff09b6df388cb4b8bbd6512",
      "text": "是吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d15fd02debec75e16032aadad3c69b148f4034082bc24866c2a3d8abd8e0a632",
      "text": "是的！带有那个主题图案的项圈、玩具，\n食盆……还有，这个也是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb744126fefb804bec96a72913b1ec5e864adc3bf6bfc59d691202a8c8dadc49",
      "text": "给猫用的玩偶吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:880823b33fb60ba4a37e51215652d354a62b6b1037b9d1d3d72fe722dee88874",
      "text": "每一件都非常可爱呢。\n客户那边也赞不绝口。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:072d86b9088c5b4392686d2c7ef5613a22ca74337451f64de68e38fe30875d88",
      "text": "这样啊，太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91c35c8e27b5f4c81f5bb0573397cce4dbb7e6e509f5bffa02dd0c582493fda2",
      "text": "（我说出的话语，竟然会变成这样的实物，\n以前连想都没想过）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5af4ee8af4c47bd538b6e57b5388e8311f8ae7c9e549519d31df3c1fa70ea574",
      "text": "（如果他们两个也能注意到，\n这是用我的想法做出来的东西就好了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_e:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e6b170a0d88f176aff3aaa15ca85fd6da7fd3b8e4a0fa80ea963485bc7df35e",
      "text": "（为此，我也要在偶像领域大放异彩，\n成为人尽皆知的存在）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_e:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
